{"no":25,"title":"Do the English Speak English?","titleZh":"英国人讲的是英语吗？","audio":"L25.mp3","duration":120.64,"question":{"en":"Why does the writer not understand the porter?","zh":"为什么作者听不懂搬运工的话？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":16.35,"t2":23.44,"en":"Why does the writer not understand the porter?","zh":"为什么作者听不懂搬运工的话？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":23.44,"t2":27.19,"en":"I arrived in London at last.","zh":"我终于到了伦敦。","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"in London","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"at last","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":2,"t":27.19,"t2":33.39,"en":"The railway station was big, black and dark.","zh":"火车站很大，又黑又暗。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was big","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"The railway station","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般过去时","主系表句型","并列结构"]},{"i":3,"t":33.39,"t2":39.75,"en":"I did not know the way to my hotel, so I asked a porter.","zh":"我不知道去旅馆的路，于是向一个搬运工打听。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"did not know way","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"asked porter","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"to my hotel","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the way","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["否定的 not","主谓宾句型","并列结构"]},{"i":4,"t":39.75,"t2":47.61,"en":"I not only spoke English very carefully, but very clearly as well.","zh":"我的英语讲得不仅非常认真，而且咬字也非常清楚。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"spoke English carefully well","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"ADVP","x":"very clearly as well","g":"副词短语"},{"c":"ADVP","x":"very carefully","g":"副词短语"},{"c":"ADVP","x":"very clearly","g":"副词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般过去时","否定的 not","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":5,"t":47.61,"t2":52.48,"en":"The porter, however, could not understand me.","zh":"然而搬运工却不明白我的话。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"however could not understand me","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"NP","x":"The porter","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","情态动词 could","否定的 not"]},{"i":6,"t":52.48,"t2":60.39,"en":"I repeated my question several times and at last he understood.","zh":"我把问话重复了好几遍，他终于听懂了。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"repeated question times","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"at last","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"my question","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般过去时","主谓宾句型","并列结构"]},{"i":7,"t":60.39,"t2":67.77,"en":"he answered me, but he spoke neither slowly nor clearly.","zh":"他回答了，但他讲得既不慢也不清楚。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"answered me","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"spoke slowly","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般过去时","否定 neither","either/neither 并列"]},{"i":8,"t":67.77,"t2":71.76,"en":"'I am a foreigner,' I said.","zh":"“我是个外国人，”我说。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"am foreigner","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"I am a foreigner","g":"宾语从句"},{"c":"NP","x":"a foreigner","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","宾语从句","主谓句型"]},{"i":9,"t":71.76,"t2":74.72,"en":"Then he spoke slowly,","zh":"于是他说得慢了，","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"Then spoke slowly","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般过去时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":10,"t":74.72,"t2":77.88,"en":"but I could not understand him.","zh":"可我还是听不懂。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"could not understand him","g":"情态谓语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","情态动词 could","否定的 not"]},{"i":11,"t":77.88,"t2":82.45,"en":"My teacher never spoke English like that!","zh":"我的老师从来不那样讲英语！","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"never spoke English","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"like that","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"My teacher","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般过去时","感叹句","否定的 never"]},{"i":12,"t":82.45,"t2":88.15,"en":"The porter and I looked at each other and smiled.","zh":"搬运工和我相视一笑。","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"at each other","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"The porter","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型","并列结构"]},{"i":13,"t":88.15,"t2":92.75,"en":"Then he said something and I understood it.","zh":"接着他说了点什么，这回我听懂了。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"Then said something","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"understood it","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般过去时","主谓宾句型","并列结构"]},{"i":14,"t":92.75,"t2":97.94,"en":"'You'll soon learn English!' he said.","zh":"“您会很快学会英语的！”他说。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"'ll soon learn English","g":"情态谓语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般将来时","情态动词 will","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":15,"t":97.94,"t2":99.93,"e